{"seq":2,"slug":"cooperative-rl","title":"合作强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/cooperative-rl","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"合作强化学习\">合作强化学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合作强化学习（Cooperative Reinforcement Learning）研究多个智能体在共享奖励或共同目标下协同学习的问题。在完全合作博弈中，所有智能体共享相同的团队奖励函数，目标是最大化团队的累积收益。然而，即使目标一致，合作学习也面临巨大挑战：如何在只能看到本地观测的条件下做出对团队最优的决策？如何将团队奖励公平地分配给每个智能体的贡献？</p>\n<p>合作 MARL 的核心范式是 CTDE（集中训练分布式执行）——训练时利用全局信息学习协作策略，执行时每个智能体只依赖本地观测独立行动。这一范式的关键挑战是<strong>信用分配（Credit Assignment）</strong>：团队获得的奖励是所有智能体联合行为的结果，如何判断每个智能体对团队奖励的贡献？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[团队奖励 R] --&gt; B{信用分配}&#10;    B --&gt; C[智能体 1 的贡献]&#10;    B --&gt; D[智能体 2 的贡献]&#10;    B --&gt; E[智能体 N 的贡献]&#10;    C --&gt; F[更新策略 1]&#10;    D --&gt; G[更新策略 2]&#10;    E --&gt; H[更新策略 N]&#10;    subgraph CTDE 框架&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[团队奖励 R] --&gt; B{信用分配}\n    B --&gt; C[智能体 1 的贡献]\n    B --&gt; D[智能体 2 的贡献]\n    B --&gt; E[智能体 N 的贡献]\n    C --&gt; F[更新策略 1]\n    D --&gt; G[更新策略 2]\n    E --&gt; H[更新策略 N]\n    subgraph CTDE 框架\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end</pre><p>合作 MARL 方法分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法类别</th>\n<th>代表算法</th>\n<th>信用分配</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n<th>表达能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>值分解</td>\n<td>VDN, QMIX</td>\n<td>隐式</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中式 Critic</td>\n<td>MAPPO, MADDPG</td>\n<td>集中 Critic</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信学习</td>\n<td>CommNet, TarMAC</td>\n<td>通过通信</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均场方法</td>\n<td>MF-Q</td>\n<td>平均场近似</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"vdn-与-qmix-值分解\">VDN 与 QMIX 值分解</h2><p><strong>值分解（Value Decomposition）</strong> 方法将团队的联合 Q 函数分解为各智能体局部 Q 函数的组合，使得分布式执行时每个智能体可以独立做贪心决策，同时保证联合贪心等价于全局最优。</p>\n<p><strong>VDN（Value Decomposition Networks）</strong> 是最简单的值分解方法，假设联合 Q 函数是各智能体局部 Q 函数的简单加法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\mathrm{tot}}(s, a_1, \\dots, a_N) = \\sum_i Q_i(o_i, a_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这保证了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_{a_1, \\dots, a_N} Q_{\\mathrm{tot}} = \\big(\\arg\\max_{a_1} Q_1, \\dots, \\arg\\max_{a_N} Q_N\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"minner mtight\">…</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2503em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，即联合贪心等价于各自独立贪心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[局部 Q_1] --&gt; D[聚合网络]&#10;    B[局部 Q_2] --&gt; D&#10;    C[局部 Q_N] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[Q_tot]&#10;    F[全局状态 s] --&gt; D&#10;    subgraph QMIX 结构&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[局部 Q_1] --&gt; D[聚合网络]\n    B[局部 Q_2] --&gt; D\n    C[局部 Q_N] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[Q_tot]\n    F[全局状态 s] --&gt; D\n    subgraph QMIX 结构\n        D\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><p>VDN 的加法分解限制了表达能力——它无法表示智能体之间的非线性交互。<strong>QMIX</strong> 将加法约束放松为<strong>单调性约束</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial Q_{\\mathrm{tot}} / \\partial Q_i \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，即每个智能体的局部 Q 值增加一定导致团队 Q 值增加。QMIX 使用超网络（Hypernetwork）来生成满足单调性约束的混合网络权重，混合网络的输入是各智能体的局部 Q 值，输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\mathrm{tot}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">tot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。全局状态信息通过超网络条件化混合权重来引入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>分解假设</th>\n<th>表达能力</th>\n<th>IGM 保证</th>\n<th>额外信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VDN</td>\n<td>加法</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QMIX</td>\n<td>单调性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>全局状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QTRAN</td>\n<td>无约束</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>全局状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QPLEX</td>\n<td>对偶分解</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>全局状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>单调性约束也限制了 QMIX 的表达能力——它无法表示某些非单调的联合价值函数。QTRAN 和 QPLEX 等后续工作尝试在保证 IGM（Individual-Global-Max）一致性的前提下进一步放松约束，但通常以牺牲训练稳定性为代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mappo-与多智能体策略优化\">MAPPO 与多智能体策略优化</h2><p><strong>MAPPO（Multi-Agent PPO）</strong> 将 PPO 算法直接扩展到多智能体设定，是当前最强大的合作 MARL 算法之一。MAPPO 的设计哲学是&quot;简单但有效&quot;——它表明，精心调优的 PPO 加上集中式价值函数就足以在许多 MARL 基准上取得顶尖性能，不需要复杂的值分解或通信机制。</p>\n<p>MAPPO 的核心设计包括：共享的 Actor 网络（所有智能体使用相同的策略网络但输入不同的本地观测）、集中式 Critic（使用全局状态作为输入估计价值函数）、以及标准的 PPO 裁剪目标和 GAE 优势估计。</p>\n<p>MAPPO 的成功很大程度上归功于一系列实现细节：全局状态的精心设计（包含所有智能体的可观测信息拼接）、合理的网络架构选择（隐藏层大小、激活函数）、以及超参数的系统调优。这些&quot;工程细节&quot;对最终性能的影响往往超过算法本身的选择。</p>\n<p>合作 MARL 在许多实际场景中有重要应用：多机器人协同搬运、无人机编队、交通信号协同控制、以及多人协作游戏（如 StarCraft 的微操控制）。选择具体算法时需要权衡问题规模（智能体数量）、观测共享程度和执行时的通信约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"角色分化与任务分配\">角色分化与任务分配</h2><p>在复杂的合作任务中，高效的团队合作往往需要智能体之间的<strong>角色分化（Role Specialization）</strong>——不同智能体承担不同的功能角色，而非所有智能体学习相同的行为。</p>\n<p><strong>参数共享与角色嵌入</strong>：当所有智能体使用共享参数的策略网络时，通过为每个智能体提供不同的角色嵌入（Role Embedding）来区分功能。角色嵌入可以是预定义的（基于智能体编号）或学习的（基于智能体的观测历史或任务分配）。</p>\n<p><strong>RODE（Role-Oriented Decomposition）</strong> 先将智能体分为不同角色类别，每个角色对应一个动作子空间。角色选择网络根据全局状态为每个智能体分配角色，然后智能体在对应角色的动作子空间内做决策。这既减小了每个智能体的搜索空间，又自然地实现了功能分化。</p>\n<p>角色分化的涌现也可以不通过显式机制——在足够长的训练中，共享参数的智能体也可能自发地发展出不同的行为模式。这种自发分化的条件和机制是 MARL 研究中的有趣问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((合作强化学习))&#10;    值分解&#10;      VDN 加法&#10;      QMIX 单调&#10;      IGM 一致性&#10;    策略优化&#10;      MAPPO&#10;      集中 Critic&#10;      参数共享&#10;    信用分配&#10;      团队奖励分解&#10;      反事实基线&#10;      Shapley 值&#10;    角色分化&#10;      角色嵌入&#10;      RODE&#10;      自发分化\">mindmap\n  root((合作强化学习))\n    值分解\n      VDN 加法\n      QMIX 单调\n      IGM 一致性\n    策略优化\n      MAPPO\n      集中 Critic\n      参数共享\n    信用分配\n      团队奖励分解\n      反事实基线\n      Shapley 值\n    角色分化\n      角色嵌入\n      RODE\n      自发分化</pre><ul>\n<li>合作 MARL 中所有智能体共享团队奖励，核心挑战是信用分配</li>\n<li>VDN 和 QMIX 通过值分解将团队 Q 函数分解为局部 Q 的组合</li>\n<li>QMIX 的单调性约束保证了 IGM 一致性但限制了表达能力</li>\n<li>MAPPO 展示了精心调优的 PPO + 集中式 Critic 的强大性能</li>\n<li>角色分化（显式或隐式）是复杂合作任务中高效团队合作的关键</li>\n<li>算法选择需要权衡智能体数量、观测共享和通信约束</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合作强化学习","id":"合作强化学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VDN 与 QMIX 值分解","id":"vdn-与-qmix-值分解"},{"level":2,"text":"MAPPO 与多智能体策略优化","id":"mappo-与多智能体策略优化"},{"level":2,"text":"角色分化与任务分配","id":"角色分化与任务分配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MARL 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/marl-foundations"},"next":{"title":"竞争强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reinforcement-learning/multi-agent-rl/competitive-rl"}}